<title>THAILAND: Thai Jan trade deficit widens to 39.0 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai Jan trade deficit widens to 39.0 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's January trade deficit widened to 39.0 billion baht from 22.3 billion in December but against 42.6 billion a year ago, a finance ministry source said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He said January exports eased to about 115.9 billion baht from a revised 117.0 billion in December while imports rose to 154.9 billion baht from 139.3 billion.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok Newsroom (662)-652-0642</p>
</text>
